From fe27c693bf2629166ee82da2efefb62b298bb567 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:18:09 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(launch): poll owned descriptors through their registered
 owners

Resolve bounded configured-launch readiness through existing descriptor
ownership and park on peer progress or finite deadlines. Snapshot the poll
layout and use checked internal monotonic time without enabling guest clocks.
Keep per-process descriptor transactions and shared native policy unchanged.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
